# Admin & data conventions

- Protect `/admin/*` except `/admin/login` in `proxy.ts` (session) and admin layout (session + `admins` allowlist).
- Mutations use the logged-in user’s Supabase client (cookies/JWT). Storage uploads use the same client to `gift-images`.
- Gift fields only: title, description, category_id, image_path, store_url?, sort_order, is_published, is_unlimited.
- Set `is_unlimited` only for Gift Cards category; at most one unlimited gift (DB unique index).
- Public data from `gifts_public`. Reservations: admin read/delete only; guests use `reserve_gift`.
- Do not expose `guest_name` on public pages.
